Short answer: execSync throws an Error whose thrown object contains the spawnSync result fields — use error.status (number) for the child process exit code and error.stdout / error.stderr for captured output. (Note: async exec/execFile use error.code for the exit code; sync spawn/execSync expose status.) [1][2]

Example:
